      "content": "i feel like im just... drowning everyone. i see the way my partner looks at me when i cant get out of bed or when i'm just sitting there staring at nothing. they're so tired. they're exhausted from trying to carry me. i'm like a weight around their neck and it's not fair to them anymore.",
