      "content": "It sounds like the weight of guilt and perceived burden is leading you down a very dark path of thinking that removal is the kindest act. Please understand that these feelings of being a burden are symptoms of distress, not objective truths about your value. Your partner's love is likely not conditional upon you being \"perfect\" or \"easy\" to manage. Instead of focusing on how you might take away their worry, focus on finding ways to manage your own internal struggle so you can be a healthier version of yourself for both of you.",
